      ],
      "source": "https://newcombny.gov/town-of-schroon-lake",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Three public access points: a state hard‑surface ramp north of Pottersville, a hand launch at Eagle Point Campground, and a village beach launch in Schroon Lake.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        7,
        8,
        9
